## Why

Niche `baby-development`: the development of a child from birth to 48 months. A random
sample of 20,000 Reddit posts (twelve parenting subreddits, 1 April to 24 October 2026, no
keyword) was read; 3,811 were on the niche and each got one main pattern. This section
covers the 1,340 of them that are about children of 2 and 3 years; the posts about younger
children have sections of their own. Digest readers then sorted each pattern's posts into forms.
A pattern with many posts was dealt over two or three digest readers, who named their
forms independently. You merge this pattern's digests into one short findings section
that the owner can read in a few minutes.

Read first, in the root `README.md`, "Research never censors" and "Conventions".

